          "value": ""
        },
        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*He waves his quill.* We settled all this already today, my friend -- you've had your five and I've marked my book. Come back tomorrow, <CUSTOM6420> from now, and I'll have a fresh dispute for you. The families never do stop marrying and squabbling, bless them."
          }
        }
      },
